Krita Nova 04 - brush editor sized relative to the screen (Android)

The floating brush settings editor restored a geometry saved for another
orientation/screen, and KisPopupButton then re-applied its previous size.
After showing (and on rotation) it is now fitted to the screen: rescaled from
the screen size it was saved for, then kept between 45-85% (landscape) /
80-96% x 35-70% (portrait) of the available screen.

